# A module declared by two `mod` lines of one file (Semantics ch. 6, "A directory is a
# tree of modules": "`mod Name` declares a child module"; "Every name has one owner"):
# `collision` at the second line, which names the first. The expected text is derived by
# hand. Written by Claude on the claude-bugs branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
mod Words
mod Words
use Words.*

@main: @unit
@main:
    Ui.Label($text=$"{Name 2}")
